# Spells that add or take away affects, cast by Smokegod (60, every skill at 100, mana to spare), with only
# area_update running. At the entrance to Mud School (3700, not lawful), with Decimus (10), Unseen (5, invisible)
# and Cherub (52). Each cast is waited out; @state shows the affects.
# - on Decimus: armor, bless, curse, change sex, faerie fire and fly, each twice (the second is refused, or does
#   nothing); a detect, which is for yourself only; a poisoned mushroom and cure poison; blindness and cure
#   blindness; cure disease on someone not ill; the three cure spells after a wound
# - on Smokegod: the five detects, some twice
# - faerie fog revealing Unseen; calm in the middle of two fights; charm person (yourself, a fido twice, and in the
#   lawful temple square)
# - cancellation on Decimus (and refused on a mob), dispel magic on a pet dragon (350, whose sanctuary is a bit, not
#   a spell) and on Decimus
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect uns
Unseen
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@as god
cast 'detect invis'
@pulse 24
cast 'detect invis'
@pulse 24
transfer decimus 3700
transfer unseen 3700
transfer cherub 3700
cast armor decimus
@pulse 24
cast armor decimus
@pulse 24
cast bless decimus
@pulse 24
cast bless decimus
@pulse 24
cast curse decimus
@pulse 24
cast curse decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'change sex' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'change sex' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'detect evil' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'detect evil'
@pulse 24
cast 'detect evil'
@pulse 24
cast 'detect good'
@pulse 24
cast 'detect hidden'
@pulse 24
cast 'detect magic'
@pulse 24
cast 'detect magic'
@pulse 24
cast 'faerie fire' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'faerie fire' decimus
@pulse 24
cast fly decimus
@pulse 24
cast fly decimus
@pulse 24
@state
cast 'cure poison' decimus
@pulse 24
set char decimus full 0
set char decimus hunger 0
@obj 20 3700 5 10 0 1 0
@as dec
get mushroom
eat mushroom
@as god
cast 'cure poison' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cure blindness' decimus
@pulse 24
cast blindness decimus
@pulse 24
cast blindness decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cure blindness' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cure disease' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cause light' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cure light' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cure serious' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'cure critical' decimus
@pulse 24
peace
cast 'faerie fog'
@pulse 24
@mob 3064 3700
@mob 3064 3700
@mob 3062 3700
@mob 3062 3700
force drunk kill fido
force 2.drunk kill 2.fido
cast calm
@pulse 24
@state
cast 'charm person' smokegod
@pulse 24
cast 'charm person' 2.fido
@pulse 24
cast 'charm person' 2.fido
@pulse 24
cast cancellation drunk
@pulse 24
cast cancellation decimus
@pulse 24
@state
@mob 350 3700
cast 'dispel magic' dragon
@pulse 24
cast 'dispel magic' dragon
@pulse 24
cast 'dispel magic' decimus
@pulse 24
@state
goto 3005
@mob 3062 3005
cast 'charm person' fido
@pulse 24
